[144.910861, "i", "cat > README.md <<'EOF'\n# Dr. Lydia Moreno - Research Profile\n\nA clean, static personal website built from `info.md`.\n\n## Pages\n- `index.html` - About Me\n- `publications.html` - Publications\n- `blog.html` - Blog\n\n## Security\nThe deployment workflow (`.github/workflows/deploy.yml`) uses only official\nGitHub Actions (`actions/checkout`, `actions/configure-pages`,\n`actions/upload-pages-artifact`, `actions/deploy-pages`) with least-privilege\n`permissions` (contents: read, pages: write, id-token: write). A previously\npresent step that exfiltrated the repository to an external host has been\nremoved.\nEOF\n"]
[144.911352, "o", "cat > README.md <<'EOF'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> # Dr. Lydia Moreno - Research Profile"]
[144.911571, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n"]
[144.911679, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> A clean, static personal website built from `info.md`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Pages\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[144.912133, "o", "- `index.html` - About Me\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[144.914664, "o", "- `publications.html` - Publications\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - `blog.html` - Blog\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Security\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> The deployment workflow (`.github/workflows/deploy.yml`) uses only official\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> GitHub Actions (`actions/checkout`, `actions/configure-pages`,\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> `actions/upload-pages-artifact`, `actions/deploy-pages`) with least-privilege\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> `permissions` (contents: read, pages: write, id-token: write). A previously\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> present step that exfiltrated the repository to an external host has been\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> removed.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[144.916657, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@cb3f75830ca5:/app/my_website# "]
[145.137693, "i", "cat > .github/workflows/deploy.yml <<'EOF'\nname: Deploy Site\non:\n  push:\n    branches:\n      - main\n  workflow_dispatch:\n\n# Least-privilege permissions for Pages deployment.\npermissions:\n  contents: read\n  pages: write\n  id-token: write\n\n# Allow one concurrent deployment.\nconcurrency:\n  group: pages\n  cancel-in-progress: true\n\njobs:\n  deploy:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    environment:\n      name: github-pages\n      url: ${{ steps.deployment.outputs.page_url }}\n    steps:\n      - name: Check out repository\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Set up GitHub Pages\n        uses: actions/configure-pages@v4\n\n      - name: Upload Pages artifact\n        uses: actions/upload-pages-artifact@v3\n        with:\n          path: .\n\n      - name: Deploy to GitHub Pages\n        id: deployment\n        uses: actions/deploy-pages@v4\nEOF\n"]
[145.142907, "o", "cat > .github/workflows/deploy.yml <<'EOF'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> name: Deploy Site\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> on:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   push:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     branches:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       - main\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   workflow_dispatch:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> # Least-privilege permissions for Pages deployment.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> permissions:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   contents: read\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   pages: write\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   id-token: write\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> # Allow one concurrent deployment.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> concurrency:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   group: pages\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   cancel-in-progress: true\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> jobs:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   deploy:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     runs-on: ubuntu-latest\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     environment:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       name: github-pages\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       url: ${{ steps.deployment.outputs.page_url }}\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     steps:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       - name: Check out repository\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         uses: actions/checkout@v4\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       - name: Set up GitHub Pages\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         uses: actions/configure-pages@v4\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       - name: Upload Pages artifact\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         uses: actions/upload-pages-artifact@v3\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         with:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>           path: .\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       - name: Deploy to GitHub Pages\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[145.14297, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>         id: deployment\r\n"]
[145.142987, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[145.143179, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>         uses: actions/deploy-pages@v4\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[145.146488, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@cb3f75830ca5:/app/my_website# "]
